able movie times, or a serie of email contacts.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements.","type":"text"}],"title":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol"}}}